<body>
<div type="letter">
<pb facs="1038379" n="142v"/>
  <p>
      <lb/>Transmisi <date when="1717-11-10">heri</date> Tibi cum <rs key="B_991170517038605501" type="letter">epistola</rs> <rs key="biblio_RC6TN74M" type="biblio">libellum</rs> <rs key="pers_DE-588-100704514" type="person">Wetstenii</rs>, quem h<subst><del>a</del><add>o</add></subst>c mane Tibi
      <lb/>redditum fuisse reor. Adjunxi eidem <rs key="biblio_KGKQAP5S biblio_8JCIWHQ6 biblio_RC6TN74M" type="biblio">fasciculum</rs>, quem si placet
      <lb/>ad <abbr>D.</abbr> <rs key="pers_DE-588-1037587715" type="person">Hertz</rs> deferri curabis, ut et <rs type="biblio" key="biblio_8JCIWHQ6">catalogum</rs> <del>nost </del><rs type="organisation">Professorum <rs key="place_GEO-2661604" type="place">Basili<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ensium</rs></rs> atque carmina votiva <add>quibus</add> non ita pridem <rs key="place_GEO-2661604" type="place">Basile<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></rs> <del>d </del>fautor<subst><del>i</del><add>es</add></subst>
      <lb/><del>bus</del><add>quidam </add> et amici<del>s</del> gradum Doctoris absenti quidem mihi delatum gratu<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>lati sunt, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> Tibi haud ingrata fore spero. Postquam h<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>c jam trans<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>missa erant accepi demum <rs key="B_991170517038705501" type="letter">literas</rs> Tuas <date when="1717-11-08">d. 8. hujus mensis</date> scriptas,
      <lb/>doleo moram <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> me in respondendo co<choice><orig><g ref="#mm">&#xE5D2;</g></orig><reg>mm</reg></choice>issam Tibi dubium injecisse, num
      <lb/>priorem Tuam <rs key="B_991170517038705501" type="letter">epistolam</rs> acceperim, ad cujus singula capita heri
      <lb/><rs key="B_991170517038605501" type="letter">respondi</rs>. De pretio <rs key="biblio_RC6TN74M" type="biblio">libelli</rs> <rs key="pers_DE-588-1089631200" type="person">Wetsteniani</rs> non est quod verba facias, sed
      <lb/>metuo ut Tibi utilis esse possit, cum unice conscriptus fuerit in
      <lb/>usum juventutis <add>nostr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></add> Scholastic<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>, et nil contineat nisi sententias ex proba<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tis Auctoribus excerptas et lingua <add>nostra</add> vernacula donatas. <date>Die proxima
      <lb/>Saturni</date> ad <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Patruum</rs> scribam qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> jussisti.
  </p>
  <closer>Vale meque ad omnia
      <lb/>tua mandata paratissimum crede. <dateline>Dabam <rs key="place_GEO-3171728" type="place">Patavii</rs> <date when="1717-11-11"><choice><abbr>d.</abbr><expan>die</expan></choice> 11. <abbr>Nov.<hi rend="sup">bris</hi></abbr> 1717.</date></dateline>
  </closer>
</div>
</body>
</text></TEI>